        "english_name": "German",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "AEW All In: London 2026 fand am Sonntag, dem 30. August 2026, im Wembley Stadium in London, England, statt.  Match Card: AEW Women's World Tag Team Championship Match: The Brawling Birds (Alex Windsor & Jamie Hayter) gegen Divine Dominion (Lena Kross & Megan Bayne) (c) Continental Challenge Cup Final Match for the AEW Continental Championship: Jon Moxley (c) gegen Nigel McGuinness AEW International Championship Three Way Match: Kazuchika Okada gegen Kyle Fletcher (c) gegen Konosuke Takeshita Men's Casino Gauntlet Match (#1 Contendership AEW World Championship): Andrade El Idolo gegen Daniel Garcia gegen ???? AEW World Tag Team Championship Match: Cage and Cope (Christian Cage & Adam Copeland) (c) gegen The Young Bucks (Matt Jackson & Nick Jackson) Falls Count Anywhere Match for the AEW TNT Championship: Darby Allin gegen Kevin Knight (c) AEW Women's World Championship Match: Mercedes Moné gegen Willow Nightingale (c) AEW World Championship Match: Will Ospreay gegen Kenny Omega (c)",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
